    "summary": "Night 2026-10-07, software 2.4.0-rc4, spec ADS-WLC200-SRS v1.3, bench HIL-2: 12 runs, 10 passed, 2 failed (TC-AP-03 in R03, TC-AP-04 in R04). TC-AP-03 is a new failure with no linked defect. TC-AP-04 has failed on all 11 nights in the history and is linked to open S1 defect DR-1001. Several passing runs have values at or near their limits (see anomalies).",
