        "text": "R03, Pinch detection at high voltage: stop_latency_ms was 12 ms against a limit of <= 10 ms under v1.3. reversal_mm passed at 163.0 mm. This is a NEW failure: it failed on 1 of 11 nights, and the previous 10 nights passed. History ranges from 4.0 to 12.0 ms, so tonight is the history maximum. No open defect is linked. The run also reports peak pinch force 103.2 N, above 100 N (reportable per TP-AP-01)."
