      {
        "test": "TC-AP-04",
        "text": "R04, Pinch detection when cold: stop_latency_ms was 13 ms against a limit of <= 10 ms under v1.3. reversal_mm passed at 158.0 mm. This is NOT new: it has failed on 11 of 11 nights, under both v1.2 and v1.3, with the same <= 10 limit each night. History ranges from 13.0 to 15.0 ms, and tonight's value is the history minimum. Open defect DR-1001 (S1, open): Pinch reversal late at -30 °C. The run's start temperature estimate was -22 C against a chamber setpoint of -30 C, so the soak may not have been complete."
